        <mxCell id="sm-product-note-2" value="&lt;b&gt;Penghapusan produk (PRD-4, TBD-5)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#5B4A1F;&quot;&gt;Kebijakan soft-delete vs blokir penghapusan&lt;br&gt;masih TBD. Karena itu, state Dihapus belum&lt;br&gt;dimodelkan. Produk tetap tersimpan sampai&lt;br&gt;kebijakan ditetapkan.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBE6;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5B4A1F;" vertex="1" parent="1">
